Create Or Replace View VWCXP_DOCUMENTOS_REGISTRADOS
AS Select T1.ProCve, T2.ProNom, T3.MovSig, T1.DpeDoc, T1.NcfNro,
T9.FecIso As Fecha_Documento,
T10.FecIso As Fecha_Transaccion, T4.MonSim, T1.DpeTas,
T1.DpeRef, T1.DpeDr1, T1.DpeDr2, T1.DpeCon, T1.DpeVal, T1.DpeBce,
T1.PerAno, T1.PerNum, T1.DpeFtr
  From CxpDpeh T1
  Join CxpPro T2
    On (T1.ProCve = T2.ProCve)
  Join CxpMov T3
    On (T1.MovCve = T3.MovCve)
  Join SegMon T4
    On (T1.MonCve = T4.MonCve)
  Join SegFec T9
    On (T1.DpeAno = T9.FecAno)
   And (T1.DpeMes = T9.FecMes)
   And (T1.DpeDia = T9.FecDia)
  Join SegFec T10
    On (T1.DpeFtr = T10.FecYMd)
